With his own thoughts
and ideas.

119
00:07:34,413 --> 00:07:37,081
My own thoughts.
My own ideas.

120
00:07:37,082 --> 00:07:39,834
Who would never
make a fool of himself.
Never ever

121
00:07:39,835 --> 00:07:43,212
